  "details": "Currently, we can use animations to control shader parameters. But there is not way to do it the other way, making shader values control animator controllers or avatar parameters.\n\nIt would be possible to do with a custom script, but these are not allowed for avatars currently (And they should not be allowed for security reasons).\n\nMy idea is that VRChat would make a custom \"bridge\" script, that would allow users to transfer values from shader parameters to avatar parameters, sync and unsynced (ccreator would choose).\n\nThis would open a lot of oppurtunities, especially with Audio Link.",
